=\"work-detail__eyebrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 18 12\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g fill=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".45\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"2\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".3\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".35\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"6\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".9\"/><circle cx=\"2.5\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"6.8\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".7\"/><circle cx=\"11.1\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\"/><circle cx=\"15.4\" cy=\"10\" r=\"1.35\" opacity=\".4\"/></g></svg><span>LIVE</span><i></i><span>2022</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t<h1 class=\"work-detail__title wp-block-post-title\">《The Beginning 2 The End 開始到最後》 二手菸樂團 EP發表巡迴演唱會｜黑熊合唱團共演</h1><script type=\"application/json\" data-work-share-source>{\"url\":\"/works/the-beginning-2-the-end-tour/\",\"title\":\"\\u300aThe Beginning 2 The End \\u958b\\u59cb\\u5230\\u6700\\u5f8c\\u300b \\u4e8c\\u624b\\u83f8\\u6a02\\u5718 EP\\u767c\\u8868\\u5de1\\u8ff4\\u6f14\\u5531\\u6703\\uff5c\\u9ed1\\u718a\\u5408\\u5531\\u5718\\u5171\\u6f14\",\"category\":\"LIVE\",\"year\":\"2022\",\"cover\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/beginning-2-the-end-cover.webp\",\"roles\":[\"Band Leader\"]}</script>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--description\" data-work-detail-section=\"ABOUT\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-description-321\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-description-321\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">ABOUT</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-detail__post-content work-detail__description\"><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading screen-reader-text\">Description</h2>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2021 年，二手菸樂團推出第二張 EP《開始到最後》，並於2022年展開全台巡迴演出，走訪台北、台中、彰化、台南、花蓮及高雄六座城市，攜手各地獨立樂團，共同呈現精彩的演出。</p>\n\n<p class=\"is-lead wp-block-paragraph\">黑熊合唱團 Formosa Black Bear 為台北場的開場樂團。</p>\n</div></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--listen\" data-work-detail-section=\"LISTEN\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-listen-321\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-listen-321\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">LISTEN</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-media work-media--listen\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-streetvoice\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-streetvoice-321\"><h2 id=\"work-media-streetvoice-321\" class=\"work-media__heading\">StreetVoice</h2><a class=\"work-media-streetvoice__card\" href=\"https://streetvoice.com/FormosaBlackBear/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/portfolio-theme/assets/icons/social/streetvoice.svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"work-media-streetvoice__copy\"><strong>黑熊合唱團 Formosa Black Bear</strong><span>Listen on StreetVoice</span></span><span class=\"work-media-streetvoice__external\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span><span class=\"screen-reader-text\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></section></div></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--watch\" data-work-detail-section=\"WATCH\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-watch-321\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-watch-321\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">WATCH</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><div class=\"work-media work-media--watch\"><section class=\"work-media__section work-media-embed work-media-embed--youtube\" aria-labelledby=\"work-media-youtube-321\"><h2 id=\"work-media-youtube-321\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Video</h2><div class=\"work-media-embed__frame work-media-embed__frame--youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/48Iz9DnwbtQ\" title=\"《The Beginning 2 The End 開始到最後》 二手菸樂團 EP發表巡迴演唱會｜黑熊合唱團共演 — YouTube video\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div><div class=\"work-media-embed__frame work-media-embed__frame--youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/onEmnRKZNO4\" title=\"《The Beginning 2 The End 開始到最後》 二手菸樂團 EP發表巡迴演唱會｜黑熊合唱團共演 — YouTube video\" loading=\"lazy\" allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></section></div></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--credits\" data-work-detail-section=\"CREDITS\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-credits-321\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__label\" id=\"work-detail-section-credits-321\"><span class=\"work-detail__label-text\">CREDITS</span></h2><div class=\"work-detail__section-body\"><section class=\"work-detail__credits\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-credits-321\"><h2 id=\"work-detail-credits-321\" class=\"work-media__heading\">Credits</h2><p class=\"work-credits__group\">黑熊合唱團 Formosa Black Bear：</p><dl id=\"work-credits-list-321\" class=\"work-credits\"><div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Band Leader</dt><dd>陳柏豪</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Lead Vocal</dt><dd>林炫州</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Lead Guitar</dt><dd>周君浩</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Rhythm Guitar</dt><dd>林彥伯</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Bass</dt><dd>黃名璟</dd></div>\n<div class=\"work-credits__row\"><dt>Drum</dt><dd>劉可成</dd></div>\n</dl></section></div></section>\n\t\t\t<section class=\"work-detail__section work-detail__section--gallery\" data-work-detail-section=\"GALLERY\" aria-labelledby=\"work-detail-section-gallery-321\"><h2 class=\"work-detail__labe